WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.267
Design an email template with AI (or a ready layout).

00:00:04.967 --> 00:00:14.033
Design an email with AI. Opens the email designer. You describe the email and add photos; the design builds on the left.

00:00:14.533 --> 00:00:24.933
The email, live. Exactly what customers will get: the design, your words, and our footer with the unsubscribe line. Computer and Phone switch the width.

00:00:25.433 --> 00:00:37.900
Say what you want. What it's for, the feel, the colours and what to show. For example: a spring cleanup email for our regular customers, my patio photo across the top, fresh greens.

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:43.567
Ideas to start from. Tap one to fill the box, then change it to suit.

00:00:44.067 --> 00:00:51.733
Attach your photos. Up to six photos of your work. Write what each one shows, so the design puts the right one on top.

00:00:52.233 --> 00:00:56.700
Main colour. Pick one of your colours, or let the design choose.

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:13.700
Design it. The AI makes the design and its words. Then ask for any change, like a bigger headline; each change is a version you can go back to. AI has to be switched on for your account; until then, the ready layouts below do the same job.

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:21.667
Or pick a ready layout. Four proven designs that take your photos, colour and words. Click Photo on top.

00:01:22.167 --> 00:01:32.400
The words. Subject, headline, the line under it, the message and the button. Every campaign made from this template starts with these, and can change them.

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:37.267
Name it. A name you'll recognise, like Spring photo hero.

00:01:37.767 --> 00:01:46.700
Save as template. Keeps it in Email templates, ready for any campaign. The tour doesn't save anything: press it yourself when it's right.

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:52.800
That's it. You can play this tour in the app any time: press Help, and ask in your own words.
